  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      202.97,
      401.91,
      286.31
    ],
    "text": "5.(1) The management of the affairs of the Corporationshall be subject to the rules of the Corporation, beadministered by an Executive Council (hereinafter refferedto as the \u201cCouncil\u201d) consisting of not more than six officebearers inclusive of the Chairman/Managing Director,Secretary, Treasurer and such number of members as may beprovided or in rules and elected in accordance therewith.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      298.97,
      401.9,
      334.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) The first Executive Council of the Corporation shall bethe Executive Council of the Foundation holding office onthe day preceding the date of the Commencement of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      346.97,
      401.96,
      406.31
    ],
    "text": "6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation from timeto time at a general meeting and by majority of not less thantwo-third of the members present and voting to make rules,not inconsistent with the provisions of this Act or any otherwritten law, for all or any of the following matters:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      418.97,
      401.88,
      454.31
    ],
    "text": "(a)the election, appointment or nomination of themembers of the Board of Management and theirpowers and duties and terms of office;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      466.97,
      401.88,
      502.31
    ],
    "text": "(b)the powers, conduct of duties and functions ofvarious officers, agents and servants of theCorporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      514.97,
      401.88,
      574.31
    ],
    "text": "(c)the procedure to be observed at the, summoningand holding of meetings of the Corporation and ofthe Committee of Management, the time place,notice and agenda of such meetings, the quorumtherefore and the conduct of business thereat;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      586.97,
      401.87,
      622.31
    ],
    "text": "(d)the qualifications and disqualifications formembership of Committee of Management and ofthe Corporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
